{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32175","headline":"秋日 · 温庭筠","name":"秋日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爽气变昏旦，神臯徧原隰。\n烟华久荡摇，石涧仍清急。\n柳闇山犬吠，蒲荒水禽立。\n菊花明欲迷，枣叶光如湿。\n天籁思林岭，车尘倦都邑。\n譸张夙所违，悔恡何由入。\n芳草秋可藉，幽泉晓堪汲。\n牧羊烧外鸣，林果雨中拾。\n复此遂闲旷，翛然脱羇絷。\n田收鸟雀喧，气肃龙蛇蛰。\n佳节足丰穰，良朋阻游集。\n沈机日寂寥，葆素常呼吸。\n投迹倦攸往，放怀志所执。\n良时有东菑，吾将事蓑笠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}